unrot (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Attention: Focus tab with focus sessions (optional Do Not Disturb),
    a one-tap distraction log, and the book's phone setup checklist.
  * Behavior: one 7-day experiment at a time, checked daily.
  * Weekly focus, learning and digital hygiene scores, each explained.
  * Coach: one next best action that adapts to what you accept or skip.
  * Ending a focus session restores your own Do Not Disturb setting.

 -- Unrot contributors <maintainers@unrot.invalid>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0530

unrot (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Reminders: water, breaks every 35 min, eye exercises, focus hour
    with Do Not Disturb, lunch, walk, reading, phone curfew, writing.
  * Background mode and start at login; walk timer survives restarts.
  * Neutral package identity (io.github.unrot.Unrot); private data folder.
  * Build with xz compression so older dpkg versions can read the package.

 -- Unrot contributors <maintainers@unrot.invalid>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0530

